  "card": "Bumps the minimum supported Clang version from 17.0 to 19.0 across CMake feature checks, CI environments, and documentation. This enables the codebase to use C++20 Class Template Argument Deduction (CTAD) on alias templates and allows future PRs to remove workarounds for older Clang bugs. Developers building with Clang older than 19.0 will be required to upgrade or use GCC.",
